AB  - 【摘要】　目的　观察家庭护理干预对阿尔茨海默病（AD）患者生活质量的影响。方法　随机对50 例患者进行分组25例作为对照者给予一般性药物治疗和健康指导；25例作为观察组除一般性药物 治疗外进行家庭护理干预（AD疾病知识、心理护理、家庭安全护理、康复训练等）。干预前后分别采用 健康状况调查问卷（SF－36）测评两组患者的生活质量。结果　实施干预1年后观察组患者干预后 SF－36综合评分显著高于对照组和干预前（均 P＜0．01）。 结论　家庭护理干预能有效提高AD患者的 生活质量延缓其病情的进展。

[Abstract] Objective To observe the effect of home care intervention on the quality of life of patients with Alzheimer's disease (AD). Methods Fifty patients were randomly grouped into 25 cases as the control group and given general drug treatment and health guidance; 25 cases as the observation group were given home care interventions (AD disease knowledge, psychological care, home (AD disease knowledge, psychological care, home safety care, rehabilitation training, etc.). The quality of life of patients in both groups was measured by the Health Status Questionnaire (SF-36) before and after the intervention. The SF-36 scores of patients in the observation group were significantly higher than those in the control group and before the intervention after 1 year of the intervention (all P < 0.01). Conclusion Home care intervention can effectively improve the quality of life of AD patients and delay the progression of their disease.
